jobs.description:
As a Freight Forwarder, you are responsible for the end-to-end coordination and follow-up of export shipments by seafreight. Your day-to-day responsibilities include:


• Managing export files from A to Z for both FCL and LCL shipments;

• Maintaining daily contact with customers and proactively monitoring their shipments;

• Organizing and coordinating pre-carriage and on-carriage transport with logistics partners;

• Liaising with shipping lines for operational follow-up;

• Working closely with the customs team to ensure accurate and compliant documentation;

• Ensuring correct invoicing and administrative processing of shipments;

• Monitoring and adhering to all applicable quality, safety, and compliance standards.

As a Freight Forwarder, you bring the following qualifications and skills:


• Several years of experience in freight forwarding, with a strong focus on ocean freight exports;

• Fluent in English and/or Dutch;

• Comfortable working with new IT systems and logistics software;

• Able to work independently, accurately, and customer-focused;

• Strong organizational skills and the ability to efficiently manage multiple files and priorities simultaneously.

We are looking for motivated Production Workers to join us!
You will be joining a team at a small, specialized company in the Deinze regio.

Do you have technical insight, enjoy working with your hands, and are you looking for a varied job in production? Then this job opening might be just the thing for you!

What are your tasks?

• You are responsible for blasting steel parts.
• You perform electroplating on parts.
• You assist in handling and moving various items.
• You operate an overhead crane and/or forklift.
• You ensure that your work is performed correctly and safely.
• You will contribute to various tasks within production. Variety in tasks and versatility are important in this role.

Who are you?

• You have technical insight and know how to solve problems quickly;
• You speak English well (understanding instructions, communicating with colleagues without any problems);
• You are versatile: you are not scared to be a bit more flexible in your job;
• You have a first experience with blasting steel parts;
• A first experience with metallising is a plus;
• A forklift certificate or crane operator certificate is a plus; 
• You are able to work independently and hard-working.
